## (query)
[Sp]lit clip at the playhead                 [S]              qrec clip split <clip> --at <t>
[S]elect [p]revious clip                     [,]              —
[S]ave the frame at the [p]layhead (PNG)     [P]              qrec frame save --at <t>
[S]witch canvas Live / [P]rogram             [Tab]            —
Trim [s]tart to the [p]layhead               [[]              qrec clip trim <clip> --start <t>
Autocut [s]ettings and [p]review             [Shift][C]       qrec autocut --dry-run
[S]tart / sto[p] recording                   [R]              qrec record toggle
[S]huttle sto[p]                             [K]              —
[S]elect next cli[p]                         [.]              —
[S]elect all cli[p]s                         [Ctrl][A]        —
Previou[s] edit [p]oint                      [↑]              qrec seek --edit prev
Remove [s]elected cli[p]s (to the bin)       [Del] [X] [Backspace] qrec clip remove <clip>…
Autocut the [s]election, or every cli[p]     [C]              qrec autocut [--clips <clip>…]
Toggle [s]na[p]ping                          [N]              —
Focu[s] the [p]revious region                [Shift][F6]      —
